:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy unit, see [[Mola King (Enemy)]].''
'''Mola King''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 3.5 Update|Version 3.5]] and can be unlocked by rolling in the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Survive! Mola Mola! Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 9.4 Update|Version 9.4]] in the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]] and [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]] globally, gives Mola King increased range. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 12.5 Update|Version 12.5]].

